  "finding": "Correct actual zip key origins are inherited from the left dimensions library. The independent explicit .17 control constructs a fresh paired material literal in the panels library. Its correct primary key origin therefore has another source_id, which the original location-only allowance did not permit to normalize.",
  "basis": "Authored source bytes, frozen left-primary-entry rule, and independently recomputed manifests only; no candidate GLB, execution outcome or runtime output used.",
  "extra_permitted_field": "source_id",
  "location_validation": "Before normalization, require each actual and control location to equal its corresponding exact five-field location below, and require matching node/program projections, stable occurrence/key/element identities, full source manifests and revisions.",
  "normalization": "At only the enumerated generated.input_entry locations, normalize validated source_id to a role-bound primary-origin marker. Existing permitted filename/revision/offset normalization may use the same role-bound location marker instead of source-ID-dependent marker strings so both validated streams compare. Preserve all five fields and raw JSON member order; independently retain/report every original field and changed path.",
  "forbidden_relaxations": [
    "No other source_id path may normalize.",
    "No operand/body/contributor entry location may normalize without exact independent validation.",
    "No source case/control byte, frozen expectation or original freeze file changes.",
    "No key, occurrence identity, geometry, BIN, material, UV, image, sampler, motion, unknown JSON, framing or padding relaxation.",
    "No blanket metadata/extras deletion; existing exact zip and inherited-origin checks remain."
  ],
